==Battleground==
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 14.67 seconds<sup>440f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 16 seconds<sup>480f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Big Sal]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**30 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**20 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is pretty easy, [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Paragon Cat]] can easily stall out the Big Sal if no other options are available, but you can easily kill them with just [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver Bearcat]] and/or [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]]. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] can deal with the Miz Devils' Shields along with units like [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] or [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]. Do make sure to bring a shield piercer for Le'Behemoth though their Shield can be broken with brute force if you have some patience.

==Trivia==
*Together with [[Bikura, Harbor of Evil]], Toy Boat Graveyard's Japanese name of "Ponpon Ship Graveyard" may be a reference to [https://youtu.be/5-TnaZU-gEw Bikkura Pon], a game playable at [https://kurasushi.com/ Kura Revolving Sushi Bar].
**The word ''ponpon'' (ポンポン) is an onomatopoeia similar to "boom" or "bang".

